shadcn preset for the prototype kit
===================================

This preset takes design values (colour roles, neutral palette, radius scale,
type scale, shadows, component proportions and states) from shadcn/ui, and the
CSS variable names of its theming layer, which shadcn-vue shares. It contains
no source code from either project.

shadcn/ui    https://ui.shadcn.com    https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui
shadcn-vue   https://www.shadcn-vue.com    (port of shadcn/ui for Vue)

Values taken from the "Default Theme CSS" (neutral) of shadcn/ui, branch main,
read on 2026-11-21 (shadcn CLI 4.23.0). Neutral steps 300, 600 and 700 and the
shadow scale are the matching Tailwind CSS v4 defaults (MIT, Tailwind Labs).

Structure (window size classes, 48 px touch targets, bottom sheet, navigation
bar, navigation rail, FAB, density levels) follows the published Material
Design 3 guidelines. No assets, icons, fonts or code from Material Design are
included.

